codex
The remaining failure is now localized: the induction hypothesis could not fire inside a caller’s continuation because the original claim fixed an empty stack. I’m adding the standard contextual circularity—same recursive triple case, but quantified over the caller continuation, frame map, and stack—so it can be reused at any recursion depth while still unfolding the outermost call through the supplied Python semantics.
